{"verse_key": "10:72", "surah": 10, "verse": 72, "text_uthmani": "فَإِن تَوَلَّيْتُمْ فَمَا سَأَلْتُكُم مِّنْ أَجْرٍ ۖ إِنْ أَجْرِىَ إِلَّا عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ۖ وَأُمِرْتُ أَنْ أَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ", "translation": "And if you turn away [from my advice] - then no payment have I asked of you. My reward is only from Allāh, and I have been commanded to be of the Muslims [i.e., those who submit to Allāh].\"", "verse_from_ms": 1620990, "verse_to_ms": 1641470, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "فَإِن", "start_ms": 1620990, "end_ms": 1622620}, {"i": 1, "text": "تَوَلَّيْتُمْ", "start_ms": 1622620, "end_ms": 1623900}, {"i": 2, "text": "فَمَا", "start_ms": 1623900, "end_ms": 1624490}, {"i": 3, "text": "سَأَلْتُكُم", "start_ms": 1624490, "end_ms": 1625620}, {"i": 4, "text": "مِّنْ", "start_ms": 1625620, "end_ms": 1626520}, {"i": 5, "text": "أَجْرٍ", "start_ms": 1626520, "end_ms": 1627330}, {"i": 6, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1627330, "end_ms": 1627760}, {"i": 7, "text": "إِنْ", "start_ms": 1627760, "end_ms": 1628510}, {"i": 8, "text": "أَجْرِىَ", "start_ms": 1628510, "end_ms": 1629270}, {"i": 9, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 1629270, "end_ms": 1632570}, {"i": 10, "text": "عَلَى", "start_ms": 1632570, "end_ms": 1632950}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 1632950, "end_ms": 1633680}, {"i": 12, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1633680, "end_ms": 1634500}, {"i": 13, "text": "وَأُمِرْتُ", "start_ms": 1634500, "end_ms": 1634870}, {"i": 14, "text": "أَنْ", "start_ms": 1634870, "end_ms": 1635710}, {"i": 15, "text": "أَكُونَ", "start_ms": 1635710, "end_ms": 1636670}, {"i": 16, "text": "مِنَ", "start_ms": 1636670, "end_ms": 1637070}, {"i": 17, "text": "ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ", "start_ms": 1637070, "end_ms": 1637860}]}